Z||000003||tgowens||07-16-2000||05:43 PM||||well.........you upload the image to your server (your ISP's server) and then go into the 'profile' section of this forum (link is in the upper right corber of the previous page) -- then go to the 'signature' text box and put in [IMG]http://www.xxxxx(whatever your server's address is).com/Getaway_sig1.jpg[/IMG] -- that's all there is to it -- then when you post a message, click the 'show signature' box in the 'Options' section right below the message screen.......<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">             <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
